# NET-GAMEMODE-LOCAL (pass 2, catalogue N-D): local Play moves the pawn by the same gameplay step as the server and the prediction (Gameplay::StepPawnMove).
# WP_Protocol names no Default Pawn (WP_Protocol.desce Settings.DefaultPawn empty -> PlayerStart.cpp SpawnDefaultPawn spawns
# nothing, GetPlayerPawn() null, no "[Gameplay] local pawn" line) and has no PlayerStart: the run names Pawn_Player as the
# level's Default Pawn through World Settings (as Details would) and plays from the editor camera (UE Play from Here).
# IMC_Default maps LeftShift -> IA_Sprint; the pawn's CharacterController names IA_Sprint as its Sprint Action, so the held key reaches the step as the Sprint bit.
# editor.log prints "[Gameplay] local pawn (Gameplay::StepPawnMove): speed N cm/s, actions ..., capsule centre (x, y, z)" once a second: about 600 walking,
# about 1000 sprinting, 300 crouched. [netgm_local_sprint] each frame is read against the last such line before its "[Shot] wrote": the
# centre advances walk -> sprint (faster) -> walk again; crouch (W up: in place) -> crouch walk (advances) -> uncrouch (W and C up together:
# the pawn stands up where the crouch walk left it, so netgm_uncrouch shows the scene as near as netgm_crouch_walk, not as netgm_crouch).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано set world SceneSettings.DefaultPawn assets:Prefabs/Pawn_Player.deprefab
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,-150,650
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.2,0
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 1.0
# [netgm_local_sprint] W for 3 s (walk), then W + LeftShift for 3 s (sprint).
Когда input keydown - - w
Когда advance 1.5
Когда advance 1.5
Тогда-вид netgm_local_walk the Spring Arm camera behind the capsule on the landscape, the pawn moved forward from the spawn; editor.log reads "local pawn (Gameplay::StepPawnMove): speed 600 cm/s, actions none, grounded, capsule centre (...)", the centre moving from line to line
Когда input keydown - - leftshift
Когда advance 1.5
Когда advance 1.5
Тогда-вид netgm_local_sprint the capsule is further along than in netgm_local_walk; editor.log reads "speed 1000 cm/s, actions IA_Sprint#1, grounded" after the walk lines, the centre moving about 1000 cm a line
Когда input keyup - - leftshift
Когда advance 1.0
Тогда-вид netgm_local_walk_again editor.log is back to "speed 600 cm/s, actions none, grounded", the centre still advancing, about 600 cm a line
Когда input keyup - - w
Когда advance 1.0
# [netgm_one_step] crouch through the same step: C held, then W crouched.
Когда input keydown - - c
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид netgm_crouch the capsule is shorter and the Spring Arm camera sits lower than in netgm_local_walk_again; editor.log reads ", crouched" with the centre where the walk stopped (W released) and lower
Когда input keydown - - w
Когда advance 1.5
Тогда-вид netgm_crouch_walk the crouched pawn moved forward; editor.log reads "speed 300 cm/s, actions IA_Crouch#2, grounded, crouched", the centre advancing about 300 cm a line
Когда input keyup - - w
Когда input keyup - - c
Когда advance 1.0
Тогда-вид netgm_uncrouch the capsule stands again at full height; editor.log no longer reads "crouched"; the centre where netgm_crouch_walk left it, only higher (it stands up in place)
